## https://raw.githubusercontent.com/firecracker-microvm/firecracker/main/docs/prod-host-setup.md

For assuring secure isolation in production deployments, Firecracker should be
started using the `jailer` binary that's part of each Firecracker release, or
executed under process constraints equal or more restrictive than those in the
jailer. For more about Firecracker sandboxing please see
## https://raw.githubusercontent.com/firecracker-microvm/firecracker/main/docs/snapshotting/snapshot-support.md
strong mechanism that enables users to guarantee that unique things stay unique
across snapshot restores, we consider resuming execution from the same state
more than once insecure.
The vsock device is reset across snapshot/restore to avoid inconsistent state
